{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, take it, move to destination, check properties, do specific task. Else, move to target, scan. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = ScanForObject    />",
